<!--
  SYNTHETIC FIXTURE - NOT A REAL RETAILER FEED.

  Every product below is invented for tests. "Example Parfumerie" is not a
  shop, the product IDs and prices are made up, and the URLs point at the
  reserved .test TLD so they can never resolve. Nothing here was obtained
  from a retailer, an affiliate network, or by scraping anything.

  Shaped after a Rakuten-style XML product feed. Two things about that shape
  are load-bearing and are why this file exists as well as the CSV one:
  the item element is <product> rather than <item>, and the currency is an
  attribute of <price> rather than a field of its own.

  Khamrah Qahwa and Xerjoff Naxos are here as the two rows that must never
  attach to the wrong bottle. Naxos is not curated and so must match
  nothing. Khamrah Qahwa is a genuinely different bottle from Khamrah at
  roughly a third of the price; it was uncurated until 2026-08-11 and had to
  match nothing, and now that it is curated it must match *itself*. Either
  way the forbidden outcome is the same one: a Khamrah buy link.
-->
